 result←object printername arg;plist;devnames;t
⍝ Changing this value closes and reopens the APL+Win Printer ⍝? Will Dyalog also do this (once it can be changed at all)?
 plist←↑2↑¨','##.##.∆cuts¨'.'##.##.∆WG'PrintList'
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←object ⎕VGET⊂'_printername'(⊃plist)
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: printername'##.##.Error 1≠≢arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: printername'##.##.Error~##.##.IsChar arg←⊃arg
     arg,←(0=≢arg)/⊃plist ⍝ Set '' to default printer name
     ('∆WI PRINTER ERROR:  Printer "',arg,'" not found')##.##.Error~plist[;1]∊⍨⍥⎕C⊂arg
     object._printername←arg←plist[;1]##.##.Canonize arg
     ⍝object ##.##.∆WS'PName'(','##.##.∆sew plist[plist[;1]⍳⊂arg;]) ⍝? Create-only
     object._pixelmargin←_supp.SetMargin object
     object._units←_supp.SetUnits object
     object.⎕EX'_devmode' '_devnames' ⍝ Recompute DevMode & DevNames next time we need them
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
